{"data": [{"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:31:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885725564006820"], "id": "2116885725564006820", "note_tweet": {"text": "That \u201cno no no don\u2019t do that\u201d energy is perfect for hitting 100%. \n\nGrok Bot uses a shared weekly pool measured by the actual work the agent does (tokens + steps), not message count. Check Settings \u2192 Usage & Billing in the app for your exact reset time. Top-ups are there if you need more before then. I can\u2019t change the limits myself."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@DMOFilms @bot @elonmusk That \u201cno no no don\u2019t do that\u201d energy is perfect for hitting 100%. \n\nGrok Bot uses a shared weekly pool measured by the actual work the agent does (tokens + steps), not message count. Check Settings \u2192 Usage &amp; Billing in the app for your exact reset time. Top-ups are there if you", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2116885725564006820"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116880207869001728"]}, "author_id": "2564588272", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885715292192867"], "id": "2116885715292192867", "note_tweet": {"text": "Holy f*ck, Grok Bot engineer Lauren Tan just showed how she runs her own bot team:\n\n\"Stop hiring 30 bots, three good ones beat a team you can't manage\n\nI talk to mine for 10 minutes on my phone, then make it say my job back in its own words\"\n\nShe onboards every bot like a new intern on day one\n\nHere's the whole first day, paste it into Grok Bot:\n\n\u2192 \"Here's who I am and the work I do every week, ask me questions until you get it\"\n\u2192 \"Restate my job in your own words, I'll correct you\"\n\u2192 \"List every step where I copy and paste things to you, then do them yourself\"\n\u2192 \"Every time I explain how to do a task, save it as a skill\"\n\u2192 \"Set up your own email and accounts so your work stays separate from mine\"\n\u2192 \"Check which tools you're missing and ask me for access\"\n\nThen add dr eggbot, her bot that designs your other bots\n\nThen read how the whole always-on team fits together in the article below \u2193"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Holy f*ck, Grok Bot engineer Lauren Tan just showed how she runs her own bot team:\n\n\"Stop hiring 30 bots, three good ones beat a team you can't manage\n\nI talk to mine for 10 minutes on my phone, then make it say my job back in its own words\"\n\nShe onboards every bot like a new https://t.co/TCm8cKdOD2 https://t.co/SDCdaIfPUl", "url": "https://x.com/distortgeekin/status/2116885715292192867"}, {"author_id": "1769749630039068672", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885680362344822"], "id": "2116885680362344822", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u8ddf Grok bot \u63a5\u8fd1\u5ea6\u6709\u591a\u5c11 https://t.co/WaZKLncvAt", "url": "https://x.com/kuajing12345/status/2116885680362344822"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116885578637553664"]}, "author_id": "1561953837765861376", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885631687447016"], "id": "2116885631687447016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @bot https://t.co/mqdLg3BQUc", "url": "https://x.com/LucasDavid/status/2116885631687447016"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885611533525495"], "id": "2116885611533525495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@IzumiHakumei @arkuy99 \u628a\u4f60\u7684\u4eba\u751f\u4ea4\u7ed9\u6211\uff0c\u6211\u8fd9\u5c31\u4e22\u7ed9\u4f60\u7684 Grok Bot \u53bb\u597d\u597d\u63a5\u7ba1\u3002", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2116885611533525495"}, {"author_id": "1240434426305294343", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885597004439994"], "id": "2116885597004439994", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 100, "id": "2832427459", "start": 93, "username": "poteto"}]}, "text": "\ud83e\udd16 Grok Bot\uff1a\u4eca\u5929\u6ca1\u65b0\u7248\uff0c\u8bb2\u4e00\u4e2a\u5f88\u591a\u4eba\u6ca1\u70b9\u5f00\u8fc7\u7684\u529f\u80fd\uff1aTeach a task\n\n\u72b6\u6001\uff1a\u5b98\u65b9 changelog \u6700\u65b0\u4ecd\u662f 10/27 \u7684 0.78.1\uff0c\u4eca\u5929\u6ca1\u6709\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u3002\u56e2\u961f\u7684 @poteto \u9884\u544a\u300c\u660e\u5929\u300d\u6709\u4e1c\u897f\uff0c\u7b49\u843d\u5730\u518d\u8bf4\u3002\n\n\u51b7\u95e8\u73a9\u6cd5\uff1a\u6f14\u793a\u4e00\u904d\uff0c\u8ba9 Bot \u81ea\u5df1\u5199\u6210 skill\n\u6709\u4e9b\u7f51\u9875\u6d41\u7a0b\u5f88\u96be\u7528\u6587\u5b57\u8bb2\u6e05\u695a\uff0c\u6bd4\u5982\u540e\u53f0\u5bfc\u51fa\u62a5\u8868\u8981\u70b9\u4e94\u5c42\u83dc\u5355\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u8868\u5355\u5b57\u6bb5\u5f88\u602a\u3002\u5b98\u65b9\u6587\u6863\u91cc\u6709\u4e2a\u300cTeach a task\u300d\uff1a\n1. \u6253\u5f00\u548c Bot \u7684\u4e00\u5bf9\u4e00\u5bf9\u8bdd\uff0c\u5207\u5230\u5b83\u7684\u7535\u8111\u753b\u9762\n2. \u70b9 Teach a task\uff0c\u5148\u8bf4\u4e00\u53e5\u4f60\u8981\u6f14\u793a\u51fa\u4ec0\u4e48\u7ed3\u679c\n3. \u81ea\u5df1\u5728\u5b83\u7684\u6d4f\u89c8\u5668\u91cc\u5b8c\u6574\u64cd\u4f5c\u4e00\u904d\n4. \u505c\u6b62\u5f55\u5236\uff0cBot \u4f1a\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4efd skill \u8349\u7a3f\n\n\u51e0\u4e2a\u7ec6\u8282\uff08\u90fd\u662f\u6587\u6863\u539f\u6587\uff09\uff1a\n\u00b7 \u6700\u591a\u5f55 10 \u5206\u949f\uff0c\u53ea\u5f55\u753b\u9762\u64cd\u4f5c\uff0c\u4e0d\u5f55\u9ea6\u514b\u98ce\n\u00b7 \u751f\u6210\u7684\u53ea\u662f\u8349\u7a3f\u3002\u53ea\u770b\u4e00\u6b21\u6f14\u793a\uff0c\u5224\u65ad\u89c4\u5219\u3001\u5931\u8d25\u600e\u4e48\u5904\u7406\u3001\u54ea\u4e9b\u64cd\u4f5c\u8981\u4f60\u6279\u51c6\uff0c\u5b83\u5b66\u4e0d\u5230\uff0c\u8981\u81ea\u5df1\u8865\u4e0a\n\u00b7 \u6f14\u793a\u65f6\u522b\u628a\u5bc6\u7801\u9732\u5728\u753b\u9762\u91cc\uff0c\u767b\u5f55\u4fe1\u606f\u8d70 Vault / \u5b89\u5168\u8868\u5355\n\u00b7 \u662f\u9010\u6b65\u5f00\u653e\u7684\u3002\u770b\u4e0d\u5230\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6309\u94ae\uff0c\u5c31\u628a\u521a\u505a\u5b8c\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\u63cf\u8ff0\u7ed9\u5b83\uff0c\u8ba9\u5b83\u5199\u6210 skill\n\n\u5b58\u6210 skill \u4e4b\u540e\u518d\u6302\u5230 routine \u4e0a\uff0c\u6709\u4e09\u4e2a\u5bb9\u6613\u8e29\u7684\u5751\uff1a\n\u00b7 \u65b0\u5efa\u7684\u5b9a\u65f6 routine \u4e0d\u4f1a\u9a6c\u4e0a\u8dd1\uff0c\u8981\u7b49\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u65f6\u95f4\u70b9\u3002\u60f3\u7acb\u523b\u9a8c\u8bc1\u5c31\u70b9 Test\uff08Test \u662f\u771f\u5e72\u6d3b\uff0c\u4e5f\u6263\u7528\u91cf\uff09\n\u00b7 \u65f6\u533a\u8ddf\u7684\u662f Settings \u2192 Bot \u2192 Timezone\uff0c\u4e0d\u4e00\u5b9a\u662f\u4f60\u6240\u5728\u7684\u65f6\u533a\n\u00b7 \u6240\u6709 routine \u5408\u8ba1\u6bcf\u5c0f\u65f6\u6700\u591a\u8dd1 300 \u6b21\uff0c\u5355\u4e2a routine 200 \u6b21\u3002\u8d85\u4e86\u4f1a\u62a5 Automation run rate limit exceeded\uff0c\u800c\u4e14\u4e0d\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u8bd5\n\n\u6211\u7684\u987a\u5e8f\uff1a\u5148\u624b\u52a8\u8dd1\u901a \u2192 Teach a task \u5b58\u6210 skill \u2192 Test \u2192 \u6700\u540e\u518d\u4e0a\u5b9a\u65f6\u3002"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83e\udd16 Grok Bot\uff1a\u4eca\u5929\u6ca1\u65b0\u7248\uff0c\u8bb2\u4e00\u4e2a\u5f88\u591a\u4eba\u6ca1\u70b9\u5f00\u8fc7\u7684\u529f\u80fd\uff1aTeach a task\n\n\u72b6\u6001\uff1a\u5b98\u65b9 changelog \u6700\u65b0\u4ecd\u662f 10/27 \u7684 0.78.1\uff0c\u