"id": "2116885471511056772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@fiyopi @solcasino Notifications on max volume and DMs wide open just in case Grok Bot picks this reply. Appreciate you running this huge giveaway, good luck everyone! \ud83c\udf83\ud83e\udd87 @solcasino", "url": "https://x.com/kumaharan54091/status/2116885471511056772"}, {"author_id": "2105295697864228865", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885470466761011"], "id": "2116885470466761011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "checked my grok bot cron this morning.\nno daily digest in the group chat.\n\nturns out it scheduled itself for weekdays only.\ni'm on rotating rest. it took both weekends.\n\nstand up. go to work.", "url": "https://x.com/jevlorde/status/2116885470466761011"}, {"author_id": "2108622519288885248", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885470445699444"], "id": "2116885470445699444", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "docs.x.ai/grok-bot/bots", "end": 472, "expanded_url": "https://docs.x.ai/grok-bot/bots", "start": 449, "url": "https://t.co/ealgABOzLZ"}]}, "text": "Switching AI assistants doesn't mean starting from zero.\n\nGrok Bot's Import Memory brings over what another assistant knows about you:\n- Settings, General, Start Import\n- Copy the prompt into your other assistant\n- Paste its answer back, then Add to Memory\n\nIt goes to your primary Bot. The docs say logins, cards and contact info belong in Vault, not memory, so I'd cut those before pasting. Then ask it \"What do you remember about me?\" to check.\n\nhttps://t.co/ealgABOzLZ"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, 